fact WorkItem(id: "WI-053", description: some(value: "per-operation compile caches (follow-up to M1-M3). Add memoization arenas keyed on reflect tree nodes: (a) decision tree for match_expr keyed on OccurrenceId — built on first hit, reused; (b) Symbol → (body_term, params) cache replacing the linear OperationInfo walk in eval::lookup_operation_body; (c) per-operation slot-index table so var_ref lookups become array-indexed instead of linear-scanned. Stays on the reflect tree — no separate IR, just side-tables. Revisit after M4/M5 to decide if a targeted bytecode lowering is warranted. Brainstorm discussion in conversation 2026-04-19."), context: none, acceptance: [ToolPasses(tool: "cargo-test", params: none)], depends_on: some(value: ["WI-044"]), generates: none, requires_capability: none, status: PreOpened)
